{"audio": "2corinthians-12.opus", "voice": "Davis", "duration_ms": 194667, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 2000, "text": "2 Corinthians, Chapter Twelve."}, {"start_ms": 2000, "end_ms": 4933, "text": "It is not expedient for me doubtless to glory."}, {"start_ms": 4933, "end_ms": 8267, "text": "I will come to visions and revelations of the Lord."}, {"start_ms": 8267, "end_ms": 18933, "text": "I knew a man in Christ above fourteen years ago, (whether in the body, I cannot tell; or whether out of the body, I cannot tell: God knoweth;) such an one caught up to the third heaven."}, {"start_ms": 18933, "end_ms": 35200, "text": "And I knew such a man, (whether in the body, or out of the body, I cannot tell: God knoweth;) How that he was caught up into paradise, and heard unspeakable words, which it is not lawful for a man to utter."}, {"start_ms": 35200, "end_ms": 41067, "text": "Of such an one will I glory: yet of myself I will not glory, but in mine infirmities."}, {"start_ms": 41067, "end_ms": 53467, "text": "For though I would desire to glory, I shall not be a fool; for I will say the truth: but now I forbear, lest any man should think of me above that which he seeth me to be, or that he heareth of me."}, {"start_ms": 53467, "end_ms": 64000, "text": "And lest I should be exalted above measure through the abundance of the revelations, there was given to me a thorn in the flesh, the messenger of Satan to buffet me, lest I should be exalted above measure."}, {"start_ms": 64000, "end_ms": 67867, "text": "For this thing I besought the Lord thrice, that it might depart from me."}, {"start_ms": 67867, "end_ms": 74133, "text": "And he said unto me, My grace is sufficient for thee: for my strength is made perfect in weakness."}, {"start_ms": 74133, "end_ms": 80933, "text": "Most gladly therefore will I rather glory in my infirmities, that the power of Christ may rest upon me."}, {"start_ms": 80933, "end_ms": 90400, "text": "Therefore I take pleasure in infirmities, in reproaches, in necessities, in persecutions, in distresses for Christ's sake: for when I am weak, then am I strong."}, {"start_ms": 90400, "end_ms": 102133, "text": "I am become a fool in glorying; ye have compelled me: for I ought to have been commended of you: for in nothing am I behind the very chiefest apostles, though I be nothing."}, {"start_ms": 102133, "end_ms": 109467, "text": "Truly the signs of an apostle were wrought among you in all patience, in signs, and wonders, and mighty deeds."}, {"start_ms": 109467, "end_ms": 116933, "text": "For what is it wherein ye were inferior to other churches, except it be that I myself was not burdensome to you?"}, {"start_ms": 116933, "end_ms": 118267, "text": "forgive me this wrong."}, {"start_ms": 118267, "end_ms": 132133, "text": "Behold, the third time I am ready to come to you; and I will not be burdensome to you: for I seek not yours, but you: for the children ought not to lay up for the parents, but the parents for the children."}, {"start_ms": 132133, "end_ms": 138933, "text": "And I will very gladly spend and be spent for you; though the more abundantly I love you, the less I be loved."}, {"start_ms": 138933, "end_ms": 145067, "text": "But be it so, I did not burden you: nevertheless, being crafty, I caught you with guile."}, {"start_ms": 145067, "end_ms": 148933, "text": "Did I make a gain of you by any of them whom I sent unto you?"}, {"start_ms": 148933, "end_ms": 151733, "text": "I desired Titus, and with him I sent a brother."}, {"start_ms": 151733, "end_ms": 154133, "text": "Did Titus make a gain of you?"}, {"start_ms": 154133, "end_ms": 156000, "text": "walked we not in the same spirit?"}, {"start_ms": 156000, "end_ms": 157867, "text": "walked we not in the same steps?"}, {"start_ms": 157867, "end_ms": 161200, "text": "Again, think ye that we excuse ourselves unto you?"}, {"start_ms": 161200, "end_ms": 167733, "text": "we speak before God in Christ: but we do all things, dearly beloved, for your edifying."}, {"start_ms": 167733, "end_ms": 186400, "text": "For I fear, lest, when I come, I shall not find you such as I would, and that I shall be found unto you such as ye would not: lest there be debates, envyings, wraths, strifes, backbitings, whisperings, swellings, tumults: And lest, when I come again, my God will humble me among you,"}, {"start_ms": 186400, "end_ms": 194667, "text": "and that I shall bewail many which have sinned already, and have not repented of the uncleanness and fornication and lasciviousness which they have committed."}], "words": [{"t": "2", "s": 0, "e": 606, "si": 0}, {"t": "Corinthians,", "s": 606, "e": 1111, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 1172, "e": 1475, "si": 0}, {"t": "Twelve.", "s": 1515, "e": 1939, "si": 0}, {"t": "It", "s": 2542, "e": 2603, "si": 1}, {"t": "is", "s": 2623, "e": 2703, "si": 1}, {"t": "not", "s": 2763, "e": 2904, "si": 1}, {"t": "expedient", "s": 2944, "e": 3507, "si": 1}, {"t": "for", "s": 3547, "e": 3667, "si": 1}, {"t": "me", "s": 3708, "e": 3788, "si": 1}, {"t": "doubtless", "s": 3949, "e": 4350, "si": 1}, {"t": "to", "s": 4391, "e": 4451, "si": 1}, {"t": "glory.", "s": 4511, "e": 4853, "si": 1}, {"t": "I", "s": 5636, "e": 5656, "si": 2}, {"t": "will", "s": 5676, "e": 5817, "si": 2}, {"t": "come", "s": 5857, "e": 6058, "si": 2}, {"t": "to", "s": 6098, "e": 6178, "si": 2}, {"t": "visions", "s": 6279, "e": 6700, "si": 2}, {"t": "and", "s": 6741, "e": 6841, "si": 2}, {"t": "revelations", "s": 6881, "e": 7564, "si": 2}, {"t": "of", "s": 7604, "e": 7685, "si": 2}, {"t": "the", "s": 7725, "e": 7805, "si": 2}, {"t": "Lord.", "s": 7865, "e": 8146, "si": 2}, {"t": "I", "s": 8687, "e": 8707, "si": 3}, {"t": "knew", "s": 8727, "e": 8867, "si": 3}, {"t": "a", "s": 8927, "e": 8947, "si": 3}, {"t": "man", "s": 9007, "e": 9188, "si": 3}, {"t": "in", "s": 9228, "e": 9288, "si": 3}, {"t": "Christ", "s": 9348, "e": 9688, "si": 3}, {"t": "above", "s": 9748, "e": 10008, "si": 3}, {"t": "fourteen", "s": 10048, "e": 10488, "si": 3}, {"t":